#ETH 🚀 01 Hundred-Day Co-Construction Plan｜Go Hard for 100 Days

Real consensus isn’t how loudly people shout during price rallies; it’s that, when no one’s paying attention and the market is choppy, someone is still researching every day, spreading the word every day, and building every day.

Over the next 100 days, we don’t promise prices—we only promise actions:

Research one mechanism every day;
Track data once every day;
Publish one piece of content every day;
Connect with one builder every day.

Only by building day after day can enough awareness take shape;
Only through genuine understanding can we weather market fluctuations.

July—sow the seeds; August—deepen the cultivation; September—consolidate and settle; October—witness the results.

One hundred days is long enough to eliminate speculators;
One hundred days is also short enough to forge true consensus.

Go hard for 100 days!
Build every day, stay steadfast in belief, and hold onto the future.
Travel together for a hundred days—clear the clouds and let the light in!
